## Working rules

Agents follow [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md). Nothing here is deleted or overwritten: every change is a new
version, and old files are moved to `99_Archive/` with a hash record. Check the state at any time
with `msw.py status` (the scientific-manuscript skill's `scripts/msw.py`; AGENTS.md says how to run
it).
